{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2022-07-26 09:30:00', 'title': 'BELLAGIO DEBUTS ONE OF A KIND IMMERSIVE DINING EXPERIENCE WITHIN ICONIC CONSERVATORY', 'text': "RESERVATIONS NOW AVAILABLE FOR UNPRECEDENTED DINING CONCEPT IN\xa0 EXQUISITE LANDMARK DESTINATION CLICK HERE \xa0TO DOWNLOAD B-ROLL AND HIGH-RES PHOTOS LAS VEGAS , JULY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE ICONIC BELLAGIO CONSERVATORY & BOTANICAL GARDENS UNVEILED ONE OF LAS VEGAS' MOST EXCLUSIVE DINING EXPERIENCES WITH THE DEBUT OF THE GARDEN TABLE. AVAILABLE FOR BRUNCH OR DINNER, THE GARDEN TABLE INVITES GUESTS TO ENJOY AN EPICUREAN ADVENTURE AT A TABLE SET WITHIN THE SPECTACULAR BEAUTY OF BELLAGIO'S STUNNING FLORAL MASTERPIECE."}